{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-11-10", "prepared_on": "2026-11-10", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-11-10</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Anthropic launches new Claude Fable and Mythos 5.2 models<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Anthropic 推出新版 Claude Fable 與 Mythos 5.2 模型</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic announced Claude Fable 5.2 and Claude Mythos 5.2, built for \"daunting\" technical challenges. The company says they improve on coding, reasoning and vision, and generate output faster than the 5.1 versions.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Anthropic 發表 Claude Fable 5.2 與 Claude Mythos 5.2，主打處理高難度技術挑戰。官方表示兩者在程式、推理與視覺方面都有進步，輸出速度也比 5.1 版更快。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1030005/anthropic-claude-fable-mythos-5-2\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Nvidia CEO's affair becomes a national security problem<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">輝達執行長的外遇事件演變成國安問題</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia is probing whether Chinese intelligence targeted CEO Jensen Huang through an affair. The board has opened an investigation, and the stock fell more than 4%.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">輝達正在調查中國情報單位是否透過外遇事件鎖定執行長黃仁勳。董事會已展開調查，股價下跌超過 4%。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/tech-policy/2026/11/ceo-jensen-huang-admits-affair-as-nvidia-probes-possible-chinese-espionage/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Anthropic reportedly plans to move forward with IPO plans<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">傳 Anthropic 將推進 IPO 計畫</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The Wall Street Journal reports Anthropic is expected to set its valuation range this week as it moves forward with an IPO.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">據《華爾街日報》報導，Anthropic 將推進 IPO，預計本週訂出估值區間。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/09/anthropic-reportedly-plans-to-move-forward-with-ipo-plans/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Claude Code is accidentally exposing secrets all over GitHub<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Claude Code 意外在 GitHub 上大量暴露機密資訊</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A \"Do not ask again\" prompt in Claude Code leads to passwords, API keys and other secrets being shared in settings files on GitHub.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Claude Code 的「不要再詢問」提示，導致密碼、API 金鑰等機密被寫入設定檔並公開在 GitHub 上。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/11/claude-code-settings-files-expose-thousands-of-secrets-on-github/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Meta releases Muse Ember, a new lightweight model for agent execution<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Meta 發表輕量代理執行模型 Muse Ember</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Meta released Muse Ember, a lightweight model for agent execution. At 10 cents per million input tokens, it is significantly cheaper than frontier competitors like Haiku and Luna.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Meta 推出專為代理執行設計的輕量模型 Muse Ember。每百萬輸入 token 僅 10 美分，明顯比 Haiku、Luna 等前沿模型便宜。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/09/meta-releases-muse-ember-a-new-lightweight-model-for-agent-execution/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> OpenAI Images 2.6 adds GIF animation, SVG output and editing controls to the API<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI Images 2.6 支援 GIF 動畫生成，API 新增 SVG 輸出與編輯控制</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI's Images 2.6 can create looping GIF animations and adds SVG output and editing controls to the image API. It is available in ChatGPT, Codex and the API, with generation 50% faster.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI 推出 Images 2.6，可製作循環播放的 GIF 動畫，API 也新增 SVG 輸出與編輯控制。新版已在 ChatGPT、Codex 與 API 上線，生成速度提升 50%。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180340\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> GitHub rebuilds Git storage as \"Rubicon\" for AI agents, handling 7,200 pushes per second<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">GitHub 重構 Git 底層儲存架構，單一儲存庫壓測每秒可接收 7,200 次推送</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">GitHub unveiled Rubicon, a new Git storage architecture for many AI agents working in one repository. Internal tests supported 5,000 concurrent agents; it is in limited private preview.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">GitHub 公布新一代 Git 儲存架構 Rubicon，因應大量 AI 代理同時操作單一儲存庫。內部測試可支援 5,000 個代理同時作業，目前為有限私人預覽。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180337\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Vulnerability that lets hackers SSH into Linux devices is under active exploitation<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">可讓駭客 SSH 進入 Linux 裝置的漏洞已遭積極利用</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The \"*sshole\" vulnerability, which lets attackers SSH into Linux devices, is under active exploitation and poses a serious threat to Internet security.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">名為「*sshole」的漏洞可讓攻擊者以 SSH 登入 Linux 裝置，目前已遭積極利用，對網際網路安全構成嚴重威脅。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/security/2026/11/vulnerability-that-lets-hackers-ssh-into-linux-devices-is-under-active-exploitation/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> France attributes October refrigeration-controller attacks to Iran, hitting 700+ retail sites<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">法國將 10 月冷凍冷藏設備網攻歸因於伊朗網軍，波及 700 多處零售據點</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">France formally blamed Iran's Revolutionary Guard unit Shahid Kaveh for the October attack on refrigeration controllers at over 700 retail sites. It caused heavy food losses and at least 15 fires.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">法國政府正式將攻擊歸因於伊朗革命衛隊的 Shahid Kaveh 單位。攻擊鎖定 700 多處零售據點的冷凍冷藏控制器，造成大量食品損失，並至少引發 15 起火災。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180349\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Google unveils two new TPU systems, with TPU confidential computing for the first time<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google 新推兩款 TPU 新系統，TPU 首度支援機密運算</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google announced two eighth-generation TPU systems: TPU 8tx with confidential computing, and TPU 8i Max for million-token contexts. It is the first year Google has shipped four TPU products.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google 發表兩款第八代 TPU 新系統：支援機密運算的 TPU 8tx，以及因應百萬級 Token 上下文的 TPU 8i Max。這也是 Google 首度一年推出四款 TPU 產品。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180336\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}